&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4797&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/ignite/pull/4797&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-9654&quot; title=&quot;Test testJoinQueryUnstableTopology is flaky in master&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;IGNITE-9654&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;IGNITE-9654&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    Fix for the *&lt;b&gt;IgniteCacheDistributedPartitionQueryNodeRestartsSelfTest.testJoinQueryUnstableTopology&lt;/b&gt;* test.&lt;/p&gt;

